  unitName: Libra of Judgement (EU)
  unitId: 740186
  unitNumber: 7143
  description: "Linked to her scythe, sensing the balance between what is alive and
    what is not, Elza became aware of the imbalance very early, when the Corruption
    first started spreading through all the worlds and dimensions. She then sought
    a force opposed to it, seeking anything that had the potential to stop it. One
    night, when the stars of Libra were shining in their constellation, her path
    crossed that of a strange man who looked almost exactly like Zebra, the disciple
    of Cardes. He held out a hand to her and she was filled with a sense of peace
    that she hadn\u2019t felt since she had made a pact with the demon."
  summonDesc: "If the dead, like the living, cannot find peace... If she can\u2019t
    find peace, I must fight the Corruption."
  fusionDesc: Her, you, I now need to protect every soul.
